# FINAL EXECUTION INSTRUCTION

Proceed autonomously.

Do not stop after planning.

Do not ask for confirmation after every component family.

Inspect the existing project, implement the component inventory in dependency order, register each real component, continuously deduplicate, validate the architecture, run the build, and report actual results.

The goal is to finish this phase with a substantial reusable component library — not another architecture-only document.